  "question": {
    "text": "<strong>Paragraph:</strong>\nA fair die is tossed repeatedly until a six is obtained. Let $X$ denotes the number of tosses required.<strong>Question:</strong>\nThe probability that $X \\geq 3$ equals"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\n$\\frac{125}{216}$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$\\frac{25}{36}$\n",
